{"name": "Hole Is Mine", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hole Is Mine is an <strong>incremental adventure</strong> about purifying a divine Hole. Dive inside and launch your Mini'Ohs to mine for you. <strong>Extract</strong> impurities, <strong>upgrade</strong> your power, and <strong>find</strong> hidden secrets to grow the Village, customizing your Mini'Ohs with incredible powers.  The Hole Has Spoken!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Break the Hole to extract its impurities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use Shelly to <strong>drill </strong>your way down while <strong>managing </strong>and <strong>caring for your Mini'Ohs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/89230031eac41c1fff61eb182d0ef7b6.poster.avif?t=1787201552\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/89230031eac41c1fff61eb182d0ef7b6.webm?t=1787201552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/89230031eac41c1fff61eb182d0ef7b6.mp4?t=1787201552\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find</strong> secrets within the Depths, <strong>rebuild</strong> the Village and <strong>grow</strong> the community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/af40cf37bf1eb9192691fab22d7e9f97.poster.avif?t=1787201552\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/af40cf37bf1eb9192691fab22d7e9f97.webm?t=1787201552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/af40cf37bf1eb9192691fab22d7e9f97.mp4?t=1787201552\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Equip</strong> your Mini'Ohs<strong>\u00a0</strong>to grant them incredible powers. <strong>Experiment</strong> and find the best combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/fca63da0dc79e9903d97678202e735bb.poster.avif?t=1787201552\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/fca63da0dc79e9903d97678202e735bb.webm?t=1787201552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/fca63da0dc79e9903d97678202e735bb.mp4?t=1787201552\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keep <strong>going down</strong> while <strong>numbers go up</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/f2aec4d3d2206f812eeae4c7bdc94035.poster.avif?t=1787201552\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/f2aec4d3d2206f812eeae4c7bdc94035.webm?t=1787201552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/f2aec4d3d2206f812eeae4c7bdc94035.mp4?t=1787201552\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Together, we are stronger!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/6aba406cbeb1bc187d8645e2bc9106b2.poster.avif?t=1787201552\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/6aba406cbeb1bc187d8645e2bc9106b2.webm?t=1787201552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/extras/6aba406cbeb1bc187d8645e2bc9106b2.mp4?t=1787201552\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Addictive incremental progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">40~ Depths with dangers and secrets to find.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize and build your Mini'Ohs with 500+ different equipment combinations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">300+ upgrades to discover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accompany your Mini'Ohs in the search of truth! (~5.0h of gameplay).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Discord</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join our Discord server to stay up to date with the latest news and share your feedback with us. You can find the link in the sidebar!</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Hole Is Mine is an incremental adventure about purifying a divine Hole. Dive inside and launch your Mini'Ohs to mine for you. Extract impurities, upgrade your power, and find hidden secrets to grow the Village, customizing your Mini'Ohs with incredible powers. The Hole has spoken!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4508020/d416